      "path": "/contentPages/4",
      "value": "Suddenly, a lurch! A cannonball which had been wedged in the underside of my ship gave to the forces of gravity, freeing some weight. I'll be needing my brown jumpsuit now. I can only hope that CentComm is willing to investigate into this new mad breed of weapon..."
    },
    {
